 Base path (simplified Dilithium-style, c = H(pk, w, M); no t'):
   Sign             588.08 +/-  17.16
   Verify           142.19 +/-   1.29

 LAS adaptor path (statement t' folded into the hash, c = H(pk, w+t', M)):
   PreSign          607.30 +/-  21.95
   PreVerify        148.79 +/-   0.33
   Adapt            150.72 +/-   1.52
   Ext               52.42 +/-   0.10

 Adaptor overhead (adaptor op vs the base op it mirrors):
   PreSign       vs Sign       607.30 vs   588.08   (+3.3%)
   PreVerify     vs Verify     148.79 vs   142.19   (+4.6%)
   Adapt         vs Verify     150.72 vs   142.19   (+6.0%)
   Ext (separate)               52.42            (no base analogue)

